{"4129690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Veteran Racer", "steam_appid": 4129690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The moment you open the car door, the world becomes a track. Revel in every moment behind the wheel with breathtaking vistas rushing past, engine notes drilling into your ears, and grip you can feel down to your fingertips. Your open-world racing adventure starts now—explore freely, tune your machine to shatter records and limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond your limits. From now on, every moment on the road becomes a highlight.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the wheel of your car and slam the pedal to the floor.﻿<br>We cared about almost nothing but the feeling of speed.﻿<br>take the racing seriously.﻿</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple: go fast.﻿<br>We left the rest out.﻿<br>All you need is your car, and the courage to go full throttle.﻿</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flair is optional; speed is standard.﻿<br>push it as far as you dare.﻿</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The moment you open the car door, the world becomes a track. Revel in every moment behind the wheel with breathtaking vistas rushing past, engine notes drilling into your ears, and grip you can feel down to your fingertips. Your open-world racing adventure starts now—explore freely, tune your machine to shatter records and limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond your limits. From now on, every moment on the road becomes a highlight.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the wheel of your car and slam the pedal to the floor.﻿<br>We cared about almost nothing but the feeling of speed.﻿<br>take the racing seriously.﻿</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple: go fast.﻿<br>We left the rest out.﻿<br>All you need